From: BCD <190844990+thebcd69@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kk: in-process opaque fd memory and semaphores (MADEIRA_KK_OPAQUE_FD=1)

madeira-bcd (X-Plane 12, round 669): VK_KHR_external_memory_fd and opaque fd
semaphores whose handles name the MTLHeap / MTLSharedEvent inside this process,
for Wine's VK_KHR_external_memory_win32 / _semaphore_win32 and Zink's
GL_EXT_memory_object_fd / GL_EXT_semaphore_fd. A binary semaphore shared this
way counts its time points in one shared place (vk_sync_binary). Images on
such memory are not losslessly compressed. Off unless MADEIRA_KK_OPAQUE_FD=1.
---
